            ^"Page" INTEGER 95
            ^"Inherited Virtues" STRING "Greater Power: Sail the Wind"
            ^"Common Flaws" STRING "Wanderlust Sail the Wind 0 points, Init (Qik – 2), Auram R: Touch, D: Conc, T: Ind The character can cause winds powerful enough to lift him off of the ground and fly him through the air. If more than one character has this power, it is possible to lift and navigate a small boat, or even a ship if there are three or more. Cr(Re)Au 30 (base 5, +1 Touch, +1 Conc, +2 highly unnatural, +1 requisite): Greater Power (30 levels, –3 Might cost, +1 Init)"
            ^"Source" STRING "Realms of Power: Magic"
        }
    }

    #ti8cguv8o4nZAEI8iV9hpW4r ^"The Stoneskinned Stats" DEF {
        EXTENDS ^"Magic Character"
        PROPERTIES {
            ^"Shape" STRING "template" FIXED
            ^"Page" INTEGER 95
            ^"Inherited Virtues" STRING "Personal Power: Body of Stone, Personal Power: Skin of Stone, Variable Powers (age or Might)"
            ^"Common Flaws" STRING "Arthritis, Greater Malediction (turned to unmoving stone until the sun sets, if struck by natural sunlight), Nocturnal Body of Stone 0 points, constant, Terram R: Per, D: Sun, T: Ind The character gains improved brawling stats, which cannot deal non-lethal damage. These stats are Init +X, Atk +2X, Dfn +X, Dam +2X, where X is either the character’s (Might Score / 5) or his (age / 10). MuCo(Te) 15 (base 3, +2 Sun, +1 constant, +1 requisite): Personal Power (15 levels, –2 Might cost, Variable Powers) Skin of Stone 0 points, constant, Terram R: Per, D: Sun, T: Ind The character becomes more resistant to damage, gaining a +1 bonus to Soak and a –1 to Initiative for each 10 years of his age or magnitude of his Might Score. MuCo 15 (base 4, +2 Sun, +1 constant): Personal Power (15 levels, –2 Might cost, Variable Powers)"
            ^"Source" STRING "Realms of Power: Magic"
        }
    }

    #tCkghBwIsCyu3azoFQVCnVY3 ^"Warder of Mystery Stats" DEF {
        EXTENDS ^"Magic Character"
        PROPERTIES {
            ^"Shape" STRING "template" FIXED
            ^"Page" INTEGER 96
            ^"Inherited Virtues" STRING "Greater Power: Perceive the Distant Truths"
            ^"Common Flaws" STRING "Meddler Perceive the Distant Truth 0 points , Init (Qik – 3), Imaginem R: Arc, D: Conc, T: Room The character can see and hear what transpires at any place to which he has an Arcane Connection, perceiving images and events from the perspective of the target. InIm 30 (base 3, +4 Arc, +1 Conc, +2 Room): Greater Power (30 levels, –3 Might cost, +5 xp Penetration)"
            ^"Source" STRING "Realms of Power: Magic"
        }
    }

    #tvtbUlwdXMZXVI90yZiz4APu ^"Character Guide: Revenant, Corpse-Like Form" DEF {
        EXTENDS ^"Magic Character"
        PROPERTIES {
            ^"Shape" STRING "character" FIXED
            ^"Page" INTEGER 98
            ^"Insert Title" STRING "Character Guide: Revenant, Corpse-Like Form"
            ^"Magic Might" STRING "9 (Corpus)"
            ^"Characteristics" STRING "Int –2, Per –2, Pre 0, Com –2, Str +3, Sta +3, Dex +1, Qik 0"
            ^"Size" STRING "0"
            ^"Confidence Score" STRING "1(3)"
            ^"Virtues and Flaws" STRING "Magic Human"
            ^"Magic Qualities and Inferiorities" STRING "Greater Power, No Fatigue; Improved Soak (x4); Baneful Circumstances (in daylight)"
            ^"Personality Traits" STRING "Vengeful +6"
            ^"Combat" STRING "Fist: Init 0, Attack +7, Defense +4, Damage +5"
            ^"Soak" STRING "+11"
            ^"Wound Penalties" STRING "–1(1–5), –3 (6–10), –5 (11–15), -5 (16-20), Destroyed (21+)"
            ^"Abilities" STRING "Brawl 3 (fist)"
            ^"Powers" STRING "Breath of Corruption, 1 point, Init +2, Auram R: Special, D: Mom, T: Ind The walking corpse can exhale foul humors, infecting a person within 2 paces with a disease (Ease Factor 9, effect as a Medium wound) CrAu 20 (Base 10, +2 Range equivalent to Voice): Greater Power (partial, 20 levels, +3 Initiative, –1 Might cost) Rise from the Grave, 1 point, Init –1, Terram R: Touch, D: Diameter, T: Part The revenant can cause the earth over its grave to open for one Diameter so it may enter or leave. The ground then seals, leaving no trace of disturbance. ReTe 10 (Base 2, +1 Touch, +1 Diameter, +1 Part): Greater Power (partial, 10 levels)"
            ^"Equipment" STRING "Tattered burial shroud; the revenant’s dead, unfeeling fist strikes as if it were a bludgeon (see ArM5, page 177)"
            ^"Vis" STRING "2 Corpus in eyes (1 per eye)"
            ^"Appearance" STRING "A shriveled, leathery corpse; its eyes blaze with unnatural fury."
            ^"Source" STRING "Realms of Power: Magic"
        }
    }

    #t9kqW9aaDRUmQmkEWHBG5l8A ^"Character Guide: Revenant, Skeletal Form" DEF {
        EXTENDS ^"Magic Character"
        PROPERTIES {
            ^"Shape" STRING "character" FIXED
            ^"Page" INTEGER 99
            ^"Insert Title" STRING "Character Guide: Revenant, Skeletal Form"
            ^"Magic Might" STRING "6 (Corpus)"
            ^"Characteristics" STRING "Cun –2, Per –2, Pre 0, Com –2, Str 0, Sta +3, Dex +2, Qik +1"
            ^"Size" STRING "–2"
            ^"Virtues and Flaws" STRING "Magic Human; Weak Characteristics (x2)"
            ^"Magic Qualities and Inferiorities" STRING "No Fatigue; Improved Soak (x3), Lesser Power; Baneful Circumstances (in daylight)"
            ^"Personality Traits" STRING "Vengeful +3"
            ^"Combat" STRING "Bony Claws: Init +2, Attack +8, Defense +8, Damage +2"
            ^"Soak" STRING "+9"
            ^"Wound Penalties" STRING "–1 (1–3), –3 (4–6), –5 (7–9), -5 (10-12), Destroyed (13+)"
            ^"Abilities" STRING "Brawl 3 (claws)"
            ^"Powers" STRING "Rise from the Grave, 2 points, Init +2, Terram R: Touch, D: Diameter, T: Part The skeleton can cause the earth over its grave to open for one Diameter so it may enter or leave. The earth then seals, leaving no trace of disturbance. ReTe 10 (Base 3, +1 Touch, +1 Diameter, +1 Part): Lesser Power (10 levels; Might cost equal to Magnitude to qualify as a Lesser Power; +3 Initiative)"
            ^"Equipment" STRING "Tattered burial shroud"
